{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/arrowandfeatherintegration"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftDataFrame"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Apache Arrow & Feather Zero-Copy Integration"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/ArrowAndFeatherIntegration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Learn how SwiftDataFrame leverages Apache Arrow memory buffers and Feather IPC format for ultra-fast, zero-copy tabular serialization.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiftDataFrame","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" integrates directly with Apache Arrow, the industry standard for in-memory columnar data. By utilizing Arrow’s contiguous memory buffers and bitmapped null representations, SwiftSci achieves seamless interoperability with Python, Rust, and C++ analytical ecosystems without data serialization penalties.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"1. Arrow Memory Layout & Bitmaps","type":"heading","anchor":"1-Arrow-Memory-Layout--Bitmaps"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In traditional row-oriented memory layouts, checking for null values requires conditional branching or sentinel values, causing CPU cache misses. Arrow organizes data into contiguous columnar arrays with an accompanying validity bitmap:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","│                     TYPED COLUMN (ARROW BUFFER)               │","├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤","│ Values Buffer : [ 42.0,  18.5,  99.9,  0.0,   12.4,  55.1 ]   │","│ Validity Mask : [  1  ,   1  ,   1  ,   0 ,    1  ,   1   ]   │","│                                        └── NULL               │","└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Validity Bitmaps"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Each bit represents the presence (1) or absence (0) of a value at that index.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SIMD Null Filtering"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Vectorized operations skip null evaluations using SIMD bitmasks (","type":"text"},{"code":"vDSP_vcmprsD","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), allowing full CPU register utilization.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Feather File Format (Arrow IPC)","type":"heading","anchor":"2-Feather-File-Format-Arrow-IPC"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Feather is a lightweight, portable binary columnar format built on top of Arrow IPC:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftDataFrame","","\/\/ Write DataFrame directly to Arrow Feather format","let df = try DataFrame(columns: [","    TypedColumn<Double>(name: \"signal\", values: [1.2, 3.4, 5.6]),","    TypedColumn<String>(name: \"label\", values: [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"])","])","","let featherURL = URL(fileURLWithPath: \"\/tmp\/data.feather\")","try FeatherWriter.write(dataFrame: df, to: featherURL)","","\/\/ Read Feather file back with zero memory overhead","let loadedDF = try FeatherReader.read(from: featherURL)","print(\"Loaded \\(loadedDF.rowCount) rows and \\(loadedDF.columnCount) columns.\")"]},{"level":2,"text":"3. Lazy Feather Streaming","type":"heading","anchor":"3-Lazy-Feather-Streaming"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For large datasets, SwiftDataFrame supports streaming chunked reads:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let lazyDF = try LazyDataFrame.fromFeather(url: featherURL)","let filtered = try lazyDF","    .filter(column: \"signal\", operation: .greaterThan(2.0))","    .select([\"label\"])","    .collect()"]}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Arrow-Classes--Readers","title":"Arrow Classes & Readers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/FeatherReader","doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/FeatherWriter","doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/TypedColumn"]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftDataFrame/documentation/SwiftDataFrame/FeatherWriter":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FeatherWriter","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/featherwriter","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Writer for Feather \/ Apache Arrow IPC binary file format."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FeatherWriter"}],"title":"FeatherWriter","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/FeatherWriter"},"doc://SwiftDataFrame/documentation/SwiftDataFrame":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"High-Performance Columnar Data Tables built on Apache Arrow.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"SwiftDataFrame","url":"\/documentation\/swiftdataframe"},"doc://SwiftDataFrame/documentation/SwiftDataFrame/TypedColumn":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/typedcolumn","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypedColumn"}],"title":"TypedColumn","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/TypedColumn","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A strongly-typed column backed by a contiguous Swift array."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" elements represent null \/ missing values."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TypedColumn"}]},"doc://SwiftDataFrame/documentation/SwiftDataFrame/FeatherReader":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FeatherReader","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/featherreader","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Reader for Feather \/ Apache Arrow IPC binary file format.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FeatherReader"}],"title":"FeatherReader","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftDataFrame\/documentation\/SwiftDataFrame\/FeatherReader"}}}